1680+ 7AE1 30 1B            jr   nc, .not_nasty
1681+ 7AE3
1682+ 7AE3                  ; 2. Calcola riga di layout: r = Y / 8
1683+ 7AE3 CB 3F            srl  a
1684+ 7AE5 CB 3F            srl  a
1685+ 7AE7 CB 3F            srl  a                 ; A = r (0..15)
1686+ 7AE9
