1927+ 7BFD
1928+ 7BFD                  ; 1. Rimuovi definitivamente da unpacked_layout (imposta a 0 = Background)
1929+ 7BFD C5               push bc
1930+ 7BFE D5               push de
1931+ 7BFF E5               push hl
1932+ 7C00 6A               ld   l, d                  ; L = Row
1933+ 7C01 26 00            ld   h, 0
1934+ 7C03 29               add  hl, hl
