1961+ 7C26 1C               inc  e
1962+ 7C27 7B               ld   a, e
1963+ 7C28 FE 20            cp   32
1964+ 7C2A 38 03            jr   c, .col_ok
1965+ 7C2C 1E 00            ld   e, 0
1966+ 7C2E 14               inc  d
