 231+ 7DE1                  ; Inizializza Eugene nello Slot 4 (offset 44) di ActiveEnemies
 232+ 7DE1 DD 21 8B 7C      ld   ix, ActiveEnemies + 44
 233+ 7DE5 DD 36 00 E0      ld   (ix+0), $E0               ; Active = 1, Vertical = 1, Eugene = 1
